---
import '../../styles/global.css';
import '../../styles/scholarships.css';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'none'; form-action 'none'; base-uri 'none'" />
  <title>Teacher Training scholarship application preview — Center for Anthroposophy</title>
</head>
<body class="scholarships">
  <div class="preview-bar">Design preview · fictional applicants · no applications or emails are sent</div>
  <header class="scholar-head">
    <a href="/scholarships" class="brand"><img src="/images/cfa-logo-2024.png" alt="Center for Anthroposophy" width="532" height="344" /><span>Teacher Training scholarships</span></a>
    <nav aria-label="Preview views"><button id="applicant-tab" class="active" type="button" aria-pressed="true">Applicant view</button><button id="reviewer-tab" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Staff review</button></nav>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section id="welcome" class="welcome-grid">
      <div class="welcome-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Waldorf Fellowship and teacher training aid</p><h1>Support for the<br />longer road.</h1><p class="intro">For Antioch Waldorf Teacher Training, CfA’s Waldorf High School Teacher Education (WHiSTEP) and TSHE. These are multi-year programs, so this application asks a little more than our short form.</p><ul class="promises"><li>Five steps, with room to explain</li><li>Save your progress and return when you’re ready</li><li>A person reviews every application</li></ul><p class="muted">Taking a course or professional development program instead? Use the <a href="/scholarships/">short scholarship application</a>. Teacher training students can also apply to AWSNA, which has its own forms: the <a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/975a6bff92e647d3ad6d9b62ab56d94d" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Teacher Education Loan application</a> and the <a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/7fb4d7bcef844cc58bdb9a5f276ea9e1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Currently Practicing Teacher grant application</a>.</p></div>
      <div class="card welcome-card"><p class="eyebrow">Start or return</p><h2>Your email is your key.</h2><p>The planned sign-in sends a one-time code to your email. No password or Social Security number is needed.</p><form id="demo-login"><label for="demo-email">Example email address</label><input id="demo-email" type="email" value="jordan@example.com" readonly /><button class="primary" type="submit">Preview email-code sign-in <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></form><form id="demo-verify" hidden><label for="demo-code">Enter the sample code</label><input id="demo-code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" required aria-describedby="code-hint" /><p id="code-hint" class="muted">For this simulation, enter <strong>123456</strong>. No email has been sent.</p><button class="primary" type="submit">Continue to application →</button></form><p id="login-status" role="status"></p><button id="resume" class="text-button" hidden>Continue saved example →</button><p class="small">Please use fictional information. This preview saves only in this browser tab, until you close it.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section id="application" hidden>
      <div class="section-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">Teacher Training scholarship application</p><h1>Let’s plan this together.</h1></div><button id="save-exit" class="secondary">Save & return later</button></div>
      <div class="application-grid"><aside><ol id="steps" class="steps"><li>You and your program</li><li>What’s manageable</li><li>Household and finances</li><li>Documents and references</li><li>Review & submit</li></ol><div class="aside-note"><strong>At your own pace.</strong><p>You can go back and change any answer before submitting.</p><p id="save-status" role="status">Example saved in this tab.</p></div></aside>
      <div class="card form-card"><p class="eyebrow" id="step-count"></p><h2 id="step-title" tabindex="-1"></h2><div class="guide"><span class="guide-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p id="guide-text"></p></div><form id="application-form"><div id="fields"></div><p id="form-error" class="error" role="alert"></p><div class="form-actions"><button id="back" type="button" class="secondary">← Back</button><button id="next" type="submit" class="primary">Continue →</button></div></form></div></div>
    </section>
    <section id="submitted" class="card complete-card" hidden><p class="eyebrow">Walkthrough complete</p><h1>Your example is ready for review.</h1><p>In the live portal, CfA would receive your application and a person would review it. This preview has sent nothing and made no scholarship commitment.</p><button id="see-review" class="primary">See the staff review →</button><button id="edit-example" class="secondary">Edit this example</button></section>
    <section id="review" hidden><div class="section-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">Staff workspace · sample data</p><h1>The whole picture,<br />in one place.</h1></div><button id="load-sample" class="secondary">Load fictional example</button></div><p class="review-notice">This screen demonstrates the proposed review process. Reviewer access, policy, and available funds must be confirmed before real applications open. It does not use an AI model.</p><div id="review-content"></div></section>
    <div class="preview-footer"><span>Questions, criteria, and wording are open for feedback.</span><button id="reset" class="text-button">Clear example & start again</button></div>
  </main>
  <footer class="scholar-foot"><span>Center for Anthroposophy</span><span>Keeping the door open.</span></footer>
  <script>import '../../lib/scholarships/teacher-training-preview.js';</script>
</body>
</html>
